{"id":"4b5630ce92265965","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-model-atomic-model.md","title":"ZFC Model Atomic Model","display":"df-zfc-model-atomic-model — ZFC Model Atomic Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-atomic-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-atomic-model","58-df-zfc-model5-atomic-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model-atomic-model — ZFC Model Atomic Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-derivable.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-truth.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-atomic-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-atomic-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-model5-atomic-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-atomic-model — ZFC Model Atomic Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c470f913608b6d60\" href=\"?note=c470f913608b6d60\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-derivable.md\">../batch14/58-df-derivable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e721d6de164f106d\" href=\"?note=e721d6de164f106d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ff9f25cca69b423\" href=\"?note=2ff9f25cca69b423\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-truth.md\">../batch01/58-df-truth.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T,A\\in V,\\quad T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(L,T,A\\in V,\\quad T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}:V\\to V\\)</span> (universal-closure operator defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelAtomicModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelAtomicModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,0}(\\chi)=\\chi\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n+1}(\\chi)=\\forall v_n\\;\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\chi))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,0}(\\chi)=\\chi\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n+1}(\\chi)=\\forall v_n\\;\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\chi))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelAtomicModel}_S(A,T,L)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S(A,\\theta,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S(a,\\{\\varphi\\},A,L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\to\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(T,\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\varphi\\to\\psi),L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{78mm}\\lor\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(T,\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi),L)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelAtomicModel}_S(A,T,L)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S(A,\\theta,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(A)^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S(a,\\{\\varphi\\},A,L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\to\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(T,\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\varphi\\to\\psi),L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{78mm}\\lor\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(T,\\operatorname{ucl}_{L,n}(\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi),L)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each finite tuple realizes a formula that decides every formula of the same arity over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>; tuple realization and derivability use their canonical typed predicates.</li>\n<li>The model5 atomic-model variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed"